Author of the Project: Lashko Illia
Scripting Language: Java Script
Notes: This is a Java Script project simulates work of the Coffee Machine. It contains some changeable variables. 
You can change variables:
* wallet
* coffee
* latte
* espresso
And variables in functions:
* waitingTime(time) -- time of making drinks
* machineOption(option) -- coffee machine options

Feel free to use and upgrade this project. 
